WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.057 --> 00:00:08.392
Slime rains down from the stinky clouds.

2
00:00:08.393 --> 00:00:14.332
Pip looks over to June's cage.

3
00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:18.375
"June! Help!" he cries.

4
00:00:18.376 --> 00:00:22.048
But the sprite is fast asleep.

5
00:00:22.049 --> 00:00:26.761
The smelly slime piles up.

6
00:00:26.762 --> 00:00:31.316
It slowly pushes the kids apart.

7
00:00:31.317 --> 00:00:37.470
Jane tries to take a step. "I'm stuck!"

8
00:00:37.471 --> 00:00:41.507
"We need to stop the storm!" Pip says.

9
00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:44.961
"I know that!" Jane snaps.

10
00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:48.225
"Use the wand!" Pip yells.

11
00:00:48.226 --> 00:00:51.970
"Don't tell me what to do!" Jane shouts.

12
00:00:51.971 --> 00:00:57.055
She reaches for June's wand.

13
00:00:57.056 --> 00:01:06.374
She holds it up. "Stop the storm!"

14
00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:13.004
Nothing happens, and the slime keeps rising.

15
00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:16.333
Pip grabs the wand from Jane.

16
00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:22.768
"Hey!" she yells.

17
00:01:22.769 --> 00:01:34.432
"Stop the slime storm!" Pip says.

18
00:01:34.433 --> 00:01:37.379
Jane reaches out.

19
00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:40.786
Pip holds the wand and Jane grabs on.

20
00:01:40.787 --> 00:01:53.100
"Stop the storm!" the two kids cry.

21
00:01:53.101 --> 00:01:56.671
The slime rain stops.

22
00:01:56.672 --> 00:02:10.632
The clouds fade away.

23
00:02:10.633 --> 00:02:15.567
"What happened?" Pip asks.

24
00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:27.846
Jane blinks. "I think the wand worked!"

25
00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:31.862
The kids dash up to the throne.

26
00:02:31.863 --> 00:02:37.505
"Your Majesty," Jane says. "Please wake up."

27
00:02:37.506 --> 00:02:44.410
Pip taps the queen's arm. "Rise and shine!"

28
00:02:44.411 --> 00:02:52.414
But the queen does not stir.

